{'symbol': 'DOV', 'date': '2023-05-05 16:15:00', 'title': 'DOVER DECLARES REGULAR QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND', 'text': 'DOWNERS GROVE, ILL. , MAY 5, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF DOVER (NYSE: DOV) TODAY DECLARED A REGULAR QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $0.505 (FIFTY AND ONE-HALF CENTS) PER SHARE, PAYABLE ON JUNE 15, 2023, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF MAY 31, 2023.'}